1. `cd /luxon && npx jest test/datetime` — report summary lines (note: if a file named tmp_barrier.test.js exists and fails, report that separately; it belongs to another task).
2. `cd /luxon && npx jest test/datetime/zone.test.js test/datetime/misc.test.js` — report summary.
3. `cd /luxon && npx eslint --quiet src test benchmarks` — report errors.
4. `cd /luxon && npx prettier --list-different "src/datetime.js"` — report output.
